== Part 2: Social Stratification, Jatis & Guild Mobility (Q6 to Q10)

#mcq(6, [The famous 5th-century CE Sanskrit stone inscription discovered at Mandasor (ancient Dashapura in Madhya Pradesh) documents the collective migration, social diversification, and religious patronage of a guild of:], (
